course-assets/scenes/module-17/_logs/m17_L17_b07_credit-loop.png.log:1763:course-assets/scenes/module-17/_logs/m17_L17_b03_ramp-calendar.png.log:15:Generate one image with gpt-image-2 and save it to course-assets/scenes/module-17/m17_L17_b03_ramp-calendar.png (PNG, 1600x900). Match the attached style references and cast-board character style exactly. COMPOSITION: A large friendly doodle wall calendar page left-of-center with a grid of small empty day squares, several of the early squares filled in solid yellow to show progress. To its right, a single paycheck: a plain pay envelope with a few MONEY-GREEN bank-note bills (drawn as blank green notes, no writing) peeking out. No people. Clean blue space at the top for overlaid code text. STYLE: flat sticker-sheet doodle illustration, thick black hand-drawn outlines with a slight wobble, rounded corners, flat fills — palette is yellow, orange, cream, white, black on cornflower-blue #62b3f3, PLUS money-green used ONLY for cash / bank-notes (an intentional communication exception so money reads as money). No gradients, no texture, no shadows, no lighting, no perspective, no skin-tone shading. Faces use flat white/cream fill, tiny dot eyes, small subtle curved cast-board nose, simple mouth. Cylindrical limbs, strong simple silhouettes, confidently imperfect hand-drawn. No ambient doodles: no hearts, sparkles, notes, thought bubbles, motion marks, icons, random props, or decorative clutter. No text, letters, words, numbers, symbols, dollar signs, labels, captions, screens with writing, or readable paperwork anywhere. Leave clean open cornflower-blue space for code-rendered Sticker overlays. 16:9 composition, 1600x900 PNG.
