course-assets/scenes/module-17/_logs/m17_L17_b04_written-plan.png.log:15:Generate one image with gpt-image-2 and save it to course-assets/scenes/module-17/m17_L17_b04_written-plan.png (PNG, 1600x900). Match the attached style references and cast-board character style exactly. COMPOSITION: A neat stack of official blank documents sitting in a cream folder: one offer-letter-shaped page, one comp-plan-shaped page, and one role-sheet-shaped page implied only by form factor. Pages may contain a few abstract unreadable horizontal line strokes and empty boxes, but no letters, words, numbers, dollar signs, amounts, tables, or readable paperwork. No people, no money. Leave clean bottom-center blue space for code-rendered Sticker text. STYLE: flat sticker-sheet doodle illustration, thick black hand-drawn outlines with a slight wobble, rounded corners, flat fills only in the locked palette: cornflower-blue #62b3f3 background, yellow, orange, cream, white, and black. No gradients, no texture, no shadows, no lighting, no perspective, no skin-tone shading. Faces use flat white/cream fill, tiny dot eyes, small subtle curved cast-board nose, simple mouth. Cylindrical limbs, strong simple silhouettes, confidently imperfect hand-drawn. No ambient doodles: no hearts, sparkles, notes, thought bubbles, motion marks, icons, random props, or decorative clutter. No text, letters, words, numbers, symbols, dollar signs, labels, captions, screens with writing, or readable paperwork anywhere. Leave clean open cornflower-blue space for code-rendered Sticker overlays. 16:9 composition, 1600x900 PNG.
