## Goal

Generate one course scene PNG at `course-assets/scenes/module-17/m17_L17_b10_comp-sheet.png`.

## Scope

- Use the attached BMH course doodle references and locked flat sticker-sheet style.
- Use gpt-image-2 through the built-in image generation workflow.
- Create one 1600 x 900 PNG.
- Show two overlapping paper documents centered on plain cornflower blue.
- Make the back sheet cream and the front sheet white with a yellow header band.
- Include only simple horizontal black line strokes on the front sheet.
- Add one simple orange seal circle at the bottom corner of the front sheet.
